WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.170
Backlit in a white studio, a ballerina stands in fifth, feet crossed.

2
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:10.230
Knees bending in plié, she glides and jumps, right arm sweeping high.

3
00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:14.590
From plié, she glides and jumps, arms spread wide.

4
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:19.120
She soars in a grand jeté, a split leap, arms overhead.

5
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.960
On relevé, heels lifted, she arches into the light.
